{
  "id": "semantic_tokens/options/03_modifier_names",
  "topic": "semantic_tokens",
  "subtopic": "options",
  "title": "Modifier names",
  "summary": "`modifiers` renames the token modifiers the server announces",
  "prose": "A modifier renamed to `\"\"` is never set. Like the kinds, the names are\nannounced once, when the editor connects.",
